      "name": "Custom Liquid",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<h1 style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 20px;\">UPF 50 Hats Made for Life Outdoors</h1>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">When you&rsquo;re spending time outside, reliable sun coverage matters. OZ Smart offers UPF 50 hats made for everyday use. As an Australian-owned brand, we understand how strong the sun can be, and how much of life happens outdoors.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">That&rsquo;s why our range includes sun protection hats, umbrellas, towels and backpacks for all ages. Each product uses UPF 50+ rated materials to help reduce UV exposure while staying comfortable across long days outside. You can buy sun hats online, with options that fit easily into your day.</p>",
