            "text_size": "40,15",
            "txt_align": "start",
            "sub_heading": "",
            "heading": "Why OZ SMART?",
            "text": "<p>You need sun protection and outdoor gear that truly works for you. Enjoy outdoor activities with confidence, knowing your skin is safe, your comfort is ensured, and your gear is built to last. The right products protect you from harmful UV rays, keep you cool, and allow you to focus on what you love.</p><ul><li>Reliable, tailored sun protection</li><li>Adjustable gear that fits well</li><li>Durable products for tough conditions</li><li>Breathable, lightweight materials</li><li>UPF50+ rated protection for your skin</li><li>Seamless shopping experience</li></ul>",
            "subhd_color": "#222222",
            "hd_color": "#0e1b4d",
            "des_color": "#878787",
            "use_shadow": false,
            "button_label": "SHOP BEST SELLERS",
            "button_link": "shopify://collections/best-sellers",
            "open_link": "_self",
            "btn_icon": true,
            "button_style": "default",
            "btn_size": "large",
            "btn_cl": "primary",
            "button_effect": "default"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "bl_image_EUdmaE",
