    "custom_liquid_PYfzMr": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "custom_css": [
        ".bottom-content a {color: #ff8b00;}"
      ],
      "name": "Custom Liquid",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"bottom-content\">\n<h2>Built From Our Own Time in the Sun</h2>\n<p>Outdoor sun protection has always been part of everyday life for us in Queensland. Long hours outside meant finding better ways to stay covered without overthinking it. That&rsquo;s how OZ Smart started, as a family-run business focused on simple, reliable protection.</p>\n<p>Every product is made using UPF 50+ tested materials for consistent coverage, shaped by what years on the Sunshine Coast taught us. More than 20,000 customers have chosen us for the best <a href=\"https://ozsmart.shop/collections/sun-hats\">sun hats</a> that fit into daily life, and we ship out orders quickly from our Sydney and Melbourne warehouses.</p>\n\n  <div class=\"collection-bottom-readmore rich-text__blocks\">\n    <details class=\"bottom-readmore\">\n      <summary class=\"bottom-readmore__summary\">\n        <span class=\"bottom-readmore__label bottom-readmore__label--more\">Read more</span>\n        <span class=\"bottom-readmore__label bottom-readmore__label--less\">Read less</span>\n      </summary>\n\n      <div class=\"bottom-readmore__content rte\">\n        <h2>Why Choose OZ Smart for Sun Protective Clothing?</h2>\n<p>Good sun protection is really about what holds up outside. OZ Smart keeps it simple with UPF 50 hats made for Australian conditions, and we make it effortless to find options that fit into life outdoors:</p>\n<ul style=\"list-style: disc;\">\n<li>UPF 50+ Protection You Can Trust: Each OZ hat and product is made using certified UPF 50+ materials to help reduce UV exposure.</li>\n<li>Designed for the Local Climate: Shapes, coverage and materials are chosen based on how Aussies spend time outdoors.</li>\n<li>Accessible Pricing: We believe quality sun protection should be within reach, so families can enjoy time in the sun with proper coverage.</li>\n<li>Friendly, Local Support: Got questions? Our team knows the products inside out and how they&rsquo;re used day to day.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>OZ Smart offers a range of sun hats online, including <a href=\"https://ozsmart.shop/collections/wide-brim-hats\">wide brim hats</a> and <a href=\"https://ozsmart.shop/collections/neck-flap-hats\">neck flap</a> styles. Ponytail hats and bucket hats are also available, along with <a href=\"https://ozsmart.shop/collections/umbrellas\">sun umbrellas</a> for added shade. If you&rsquo;re not sure where to start, our <a href=\"https://ozsmart.shop/blogs/news/ultimate-guide-sun-protection-australia\">ultimate guide to sun protection</a> walks through what to look for and how to choose.</p>\n<p>You can also browse sun protective clothing alongside <a href=\"https://ozsmart.shop/collections/beach-towels\">sand-free towels</a> for beach days, plus <a href=\"https://ozsmart.shop/collections/bags-backpacks\">backpacks and bags</a> that make everyday carry simple. It&rsquo;s all the gear you&rsquo;ll need when you&rsquo;re heading out the door.</p>\n<h2>Easy Ordering &amp; Returns</h2>\n<p>Ordering is simple with secure checkout when you buy sun hats online. Returns are easy with a 90-day window and a satisfaction guarantee. Shipping is fast across Australia and New Zealand, with delivery also available to the United States.</p>\n      </div>\n    </details>\n  </div>\n</div>\n  <style>\n.bottom-content .metafield-rich_text_field a {\n    display: inline;\n    font-weight: normal;\n    border: 0;\n    padding: 0 !important;\n    background: none !important;\n    font-size: inherit;\n}\n.bottom-content .metafield-rich_text_field a:before {\ndisplay: none;}\n.bottom-content .metafield-rich_text_field a:hover {\ntext-decoration: underline;\n    color: orange;\n}\n    .collection-bottom-readmore {\n      margin: 0 auto;\n    }\n\n    /* Stack content first, toggle second */\n    .bottom-readmore {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-areas:\n        \"content\"\n        \"toggle\";\n    }\n\n    .bottom-readmore__content {\n      grid-area: content;\n      margin-bottom: 12px;\n    }\n\n    .bottom-readmore__summary {\n      grid-area: toggle;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      list-style: none;\n      display: inline-flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 8px;\n      user-select: none;\n      font-weight: 600; /* slightly bolder */\n    }\n\n    .bottom-readmore__summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }\n    .bottom-readmore__summary::marker { content: \"\"; }\n\n    .bottom-readmore__label--less { display: none; }\n    details[open] .bottom-readmore__label--more { display: none; }\n    details[open] .bottom-readmore__label--less { display: inline; }\n  </style>",
        "layout": "t4s-container-wrap",
        "cl_bg": "",
        "cl_bg_gradient": "",
        "mg": ",,50px,",
        "pd": "",
        "mg_tb": "",
